{
  "_readme": [
    "One row per retailer marketplace. scripts/generate-retailer-adapters.mjs turns each row into",
    "packages/backend/src/adapters/<region>/<slug>.json, <slug>.live.spec.ts and",
    "packages/frontend/public/logos/connectors/<slug>.svg, from the tools of the adapter named in `source`.",
    "Edit a row here and run the generator; never edit the generated files by hand (CI runs --check).",
    "hosts: one entry fixes the base URL; several entries become a choice at install (envVarMeta.options).",
    "keyPath: menu path to the API key in the seller back office, parts separated by ' > '.",
    "sellerHelpUrl: the retailer's own seller help or application page; null uses the back office sign-in page.",
    "sources: where the host and the access rule come from (not shown to users)."
  ],
